# SurveyMonkey

SurveyMonkey is a leading continuous insights platform that turns feedback into fast, confident decisions. 
Built for agile Marketing, CX, and HR teams, SurveyMonkey combines AI-powered survey creation and analysis — grounded in 100B+ questions answered over 25+ years — with continuous listening programs and a global panel of 335M+ respondents. 
Trusted by 95% of Fortune 500 companies and 42M+ users worldwide, with 200+ integrations (including Salesforce, HubSpot, and Slack) and enterprise plans that add SSO, HIPAA-eligible configurations, and GDPR support.

